 "statement": "The fixed published Lucas index 7351 reconstructs a 3673-bit prime Frobenius conductor for the ordinary model y^2+xy=x^3+1 over GF(2^7351), with geometric source endomorphism conductor 1. Native PARI and C++ GMP arithmetic agree; PARI generates and validates a complete ECPP certificate, a fresh GP process recomputes the subject and accepts replay, and a changed subject rejects. This is same-host unsigned producer evidence for the exact conductor prime, not a supplied lower endpoint, explicit isogeny crossing, measured ECDLP result or world record."
